<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 3 Best in Slot Gear list for Combat Rogue DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Trial of the Crusader, Ulduar, Naxxramas, Obsidian Sanctum, and Eye of Eternity. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Combat Rogue DPS Phase 3</h2>Here is the full set of best in slot gear for a combat rogue in Phase 3. While you are gearing up in Phase 3 you should utilize your gem slots to make sure you are at or above the poison hit cap and at the expertise cap. The gems in this layout are specifically for when you have the full set, so if you are missing some big hit or expertise pieces you will need to compensate by replacing AP gems with hit or expertise gems. If you need a refresher on your hit and expertise caps, be sure to check out <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/combat-rogue-dps-stat-priority-and-attributes-wrath-of-the-lich-king-classic-16038">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Combat Rogue DPS Stat Priority and Attributes - Wrath of the Lich King Classic</span></a>.<br/>
