<br/>
<br/>For combat rogues in this phase, the tier armor alone will put you over the expertise cap. The alternative pieces in those slots are so much worse that this is still the best way to setup your gear, despite the wasted expertise from going over the cap.<br/>
<br/>You'll be using four pieces of the tier set <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-188/triumphant-vancleefs-battlegear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Triumphant VanCleef's Battlegear</span></a> this phase mostly because the items themselves are quite strong. The two piece bonus for <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=48672/rupture">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_rupture.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rupture</span></a> is rather unremarkable due to it's extremely low chance to trigger. The four piece bonus isn't anything flashy but it is a solid boost to your damage and decent bonus.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Triumph for Combat Rogue DPS Phase 3</h3>None of the items you can buy with <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> are best in slot for phase 3, so there are no clear priority items to get from Emblems. If you are fully geared up with Ulduar Hardmode loot from last phase, there is not much here for you except maybe a 4th piece of the ilvl 245 tier set once you've acquired 3/<wbr/>5 of the ilvl 258 tier set. For players without as much gear, what is good depends on what you already have. I'd stay away from the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47659/crimson-star">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_throwingknife_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crimson Star</span></a> as we'll have more than enough expertise on tier armor this phase and don't want any more. In most circumstances I'd say the ilvl 245 tier armor will be the best pieces to pick up with your <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a>.<br/>
