<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Combat Rogue DPS Phase 3</h3>Like the helmet, our tier armor <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48228/vancleefs-pauldrons-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_89.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">VanCleef's Pauldrons of Triumph</span></a> /<wbr/> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48237/garonas-pauldrons-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_109a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Garona's Pauldrons of Triumph</span></a></span> is an easy choice as it both helps us get to the good set bonuses and is just the individually strongest item available for the slot. <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47972/spaulders-of-the-snow-bandit">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_89.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spaulders of the Snow Bandit</span></a> /<wbr/> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48049/shoulderpads-of-the-snow-bandit">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_109a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shoulderpads of the Snow Bandit</span></a></span> are worth pointing out as an option while you are gearing up because they are the best non-expertise option in this slot. The difficulty with gearing as a Combat rogue is almost always about having <i>too much</i> expertise on your gear - if your other slots have a lot of expertise you might want to use the Snow Bandits.<br/>
<br/>Specifically for Orc rogues due to their racial expertise bonus with Axes, <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48049/shoulderpads-of-the-snow-bandit">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_109a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shoulderpads of the Snow Bandit</span></a></span> can be used as an alternative setup alongside <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48236/garonas-legplates-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_leather_30a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Garona's Legplates of Triumph</span></a></span> in the legs. This is an alternative setup and is not meaningfully different in performance from the standard setup everyone else will use.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=61117/masters-inscription-of-the-axe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Master's Inscription of the Axe</span></a> (Inscription) &gt; <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50335/greater-inscription-of-the-axe">
