<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Combat Rogue DPS Phase 3</h3>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47155/bracers-of-dark-determination">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_23b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Dark Determination</span></a> /<wbr/> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47474/armbands-of-dark-determination">
