<span class="tinyicontxt">Anub'arak</span></a>. The crafted <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47581/bracers-of-swift-death">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_23b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Swift Death</span></a> /<wbr/> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47582/bracers-of-swift-death">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_36a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Swift Death</span></a></span> and non-heroic <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47151/bracers-of-dark-determination">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_23b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Dark Determination</span></a> /<wbr/> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47313/armbands-of-dark-determination">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_36a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armbands of Dark Determination</span></a></span> are nearly identical in performance and tied for second best option.<br/>
