<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Combat Rogue DPS Phase 3</h3>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46975/leggings-of-the-broken-beast">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_leather_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Broken Beast</span></a> /<wbr/> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47420/legwraps-of-the-broken-beast">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_leather_30a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legwraps of the Broken Beast</span></a></span> are the choice for your leg slot. This is your ideal "off piece" among the 5 slots that could be occupied by your tier set. The Broken Beast legs offer quite a bit better stats than the tier legs, more than any of the other non-tier options for other slots. We can equip these on the legs then tier armor in the helm, shoulders, chest, and gloves to activate the four piece bonus.<br/>
<br/>Specifically for Orc rogues due to their racial expertise bonus with Axes, <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48236/garonas-legplates-of-triumph">
