<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Combat Rogue DPS Phase 3</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-combat-rogue-dps-phase-3">Main Hand Weapons for Combat Rogue DPS Phase 3</h4>The best weapons available this phase happen to be Axes, so once you get your hands on those you'll want to use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=13964/hack-and-slash">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hack and Slash</span></a> talent to match them. <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47156/stormpike-cleaver">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_105.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormpike Cleaver</span></a> /<wbr/> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47475/hellscream-slicer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_104.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hellscream Slicer</span></a></span> is your best main hand this phase and has quite a few strong off hand weapon combinations to go with it. Depending on what weapons you have available, you may find yourself keeping <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45132/golden-saronite-dragon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_hand_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Saronite Dragon</span></a> from last phase for a while - be sure to check out the weapon combinations listed below to see how different weapon pairs compare.<br/>
