<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-combat-rogue-dps-phase-3">Off Hand Weapons for Combat Rogue DPS Phase 3</h4>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47001/lionhead-slasher">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_105.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lionhead Slasher</span></a> /<wbr/> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47427/blood-fury">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_104.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Fury</span></a></span> is the best off hand weapon for Combat rogues in Phase 3. The second and third best options <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46036/void-sabre">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Void Sabre</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45331/rune-etched-nightblade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_135.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune-Etched Nightblade</span></a> are quite close to each other in performance. The 1.4 speed on the Rune-Etched Nightblade makes it perform much better than it's item level suggests, offering more <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=13964/hack-and-slash">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hack and Slash</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=35553/combat-potency">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Combat Potency</span></a>, and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57973/deadly-poison-ix">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_dualweild.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deadly Poison IX</span></a> triggers which are all very valuable.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59621/enchant-weapon-berserking">
